 "check": {
  "describe": "Title 'Little island' and a hint at the top, a 'Sea level  0 m' slider at the bottom; between them a square block of earth seen from above at an angle: a deep-blue sea with a turquoise shallows ring and white surf round a low-poly island — sand beaches, light and dark green slopes with small dark cone trees, grey rock and a snowy peak; brown earth walls below the sea's sides. Light: pale blue to cream sky; dark: navy night with stars. Later in time it has turned; dragging turns and tilts it; raising the slider floods the lowlands (only rock and snow above a ring of sand). Mono: a white (or black) hidden-line grid of the island with the sea flat.",
